{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brother Lance, Judge of the Sanctum Guard, was the realm\u2019s shield... until he vanished. Master precise combat skills as you take on the role of <strong>Lucian</strong>, an <strong>aspiring Knight</strong> venturing through a dying kingdom where an unseen force twists reality into nightmare and hope fades as the <strong>Blight</strong> spreads. Whether you <strong>choose</strong> to aid the citizens of Eireos, or watch them fall to the corruption - <i>this choice is yours</i>. <strong>This is your fight. This is your redemption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/03ee6cf6ac89b4ebc2dd0129487c5f70.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/03ee6cf6ac89b4ebc2dd0129487c5f70.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/03ee6cf6ac89b4ebc2dd0129487c5f70.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a Dynamic Combat System:</strong>\u00a0Wield a variety of weapons and abilities in a fast, responsive combat system built around parries, dodges, counters, fluid combos, and environmental awareness. Success comes from timing, positioning, and mastery \u2014 not button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/a01f757cae5a182772472adaff5fa7bc.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/a01f757cae5a182772472adaff5fa7bc.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/a01f757cae5a182772472adaff5fa7bc.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Hand-Crafted World:</strong>\u00a0Journey through a beautifully animated pixel art world inspired by classic JRPGs. Discover hidden treasures, solve Zelda-style puzzles, explore ancient ruins, and visit tightly-knit towns spread across four distinct regions of Eireos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/4509ca99fab5758801cfdfe360a38a2f.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/4509ca99fab5758801cfdfe360a38a2f.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/4509ca99fab5758801cfdfe360a38a2f.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purify the Corruption:</strong> As the fabled Blight surfaces once again, it's up to you whether you help (or ignore!) struggling citizens. But be warned, your choices will have real consequences on the world... those who are lost to the Blight, never return...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/5147ef205d8f7ba102c6c83c58cccded.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/5147ef205d8f7ba102c6c83c58cccded.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/5147ef205d8f7ba102c6c83c58cccded.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Playstyle:</strong>\u00a0Choose from four distinct classes, each with unique skills and specialisations, and freely switch between them to suit your approach. And for those willing to walk a dangerous line, the Blight itself offers powerful \u2014 but costly \u2014 corrupted abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/cd8bb963fc6db60271e954c2554ea57d.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/cd8bb963fc6db60271e954c2554ea57d.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/cd8bb963fc6db60271e954c2554ea57d.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience an Emotional Story:</strong>\u00a0Experience a narrative about brotherhood, sacrifice, and the burden of trying to save someone you love. Inspired by the emotional depth and high-stakes storytelling of classic JRPGs, Colossus is a journey where strength alone is never enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/bdbf43a2bf4aa43702b1f0f86c2087fa.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/bdbf43a2bf4aa43702b1f0f86c2087fa.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/bdbf43a2bf4aa43702b1f0f86c2087fa.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1722800?t=1770202494","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1722800?t=1770202494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/6ddcde343b1963025f90359fe6f9c877f513cb3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770202494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/6ddcde343b1963025f90359fe6f9c877f513cb3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770202494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brother Lance, Judge of the Sanctum Guard, was the realm\u2019s shield... until he vanished. Master precise combat skills as you take on the role of <strong>Lucian</strong>, an <strong>aspiring Knight</strong> venturing through a dying kingdom where an unseen force twists reality into nightmare and hope fades as the <strong>Blight</strong> spreads. Whether you <strong>choose</strong> to aid the citizens of Eireos, or watch them fall to the corruption - <i>this choice is yours</i>. <strong>This is your fight. This is your redemption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\