Blight itself offers powerful \u2014 but costly \u2014 corrupted abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/cd8bb963fc6db60271e954c2554ea57d.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/cd8bb963fc6db60271e954c2554ea57d.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/cd8bb963fc6db60271e954c2554ea57d.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience an Emotional Story:</strong>\u00a0Experience a narrative about brotherhood, sacrifice, and the burden of trying to save someone you love. Inspired by the emotional depth and high-stakes storytelling of classic JRPGs, Colossus is a journey where strength alone is never enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/bdbf43a2bf4aa43702b1f0f86c2087fa.poster.avif?t=1770202494\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/bdbf43a2bf4aa43702b1f0f86c2087fa.webm?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/bdbf43a2bf4aa43702b1f0f86c2087fa.mp4?t=1770202494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["RUSTIC PANDA GAMES LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}]